#import "/modern-iaf/manuals/layout/manual.typ": *

From the #term("Hangar") to the cockpit takes four steps. The jet's own start-up is in its manual (@manuals).

+ On the Hangar, select a jet under #scr("aircraft") (@hangar).
+ Select #scr("fly"). The #scr("missions") screen opens (@mission-list).
+ Select #scr("sec_fly_now"), and pick your flight, its start and its time (@mission-list-scramble).
+ Select #scr("fly"). The loading screen runs (@loading) and you sit in the cockpit.

The #term("Notebook")'s checklist guides the flight (@notebook). #scr("sec_training") on the same screen holds the jet's training course, phase by phase (@mission-list-training); its lessons' flights come in a later version.
